{"user": "how do i better the skill in my next game", "user_ts": "2026-08-18T20:51:59.818564+00:00", "assistant": "To improve next game, focus on these habits:\n\n1. **Don\u2019t chase flips early.** A big move now can give White better moves later.\n2. **Value corners most.** Corners can\u2019t be flipped, and they often secure whole edges.\n3. **Avoid squares next to empty corners** unless you\u2019re sure White cannot take the corner next.\n4. **Think mobility:** ask, \u201cAfter I move, how many good moves does White have?\u201d\n5. **In the endgame, count.** Try to predict the last few moves, not just the immediate flip count.\n6. **If you have no legal move, you pass.** The opponent keeps moving until you have a legal move or the board ends.\n\nA good question before each move:  \n**\u201cDoes this move give White a corner or reduce White\u2019s options?\u201d**", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-18T20:52:01.222132+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-18T20:52:04.146960+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Solution Request"], "consensus": ["Solution Request"], "votes": {"Solution Request": 2, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 1}, "confidence": {"Solution Request": 0.6666666666666666, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "llama": ["Solution Request"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["General Principle", "Prompt"], "consensus": ["General Principle", "Prompt"], "votes": {"General Principle": 3, "Prompt": 2, "Hint": 1}, "confidence": {"General Principle": 1.0, "Prompt": 0.6666666666666666, "Hint": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["General Principle", "Prompt"], "sonnet": ["General Principle", "Prompt"], "llama": ["General Principle", "Hint"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Direc